"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:294
#: 2fa4560f1535484ba4c6e07731b783cf 7f80257d25fb415db8515fba3e79029a
